# App
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=tpl
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api

# The template uses a same-origin product API by default. Authentication,
# session storage and provider credentials belong to the backend/BFF contract;
# they must not be placed in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables or this file.
# A cross-origin URL is allowed only for an explicitly documented isolated
# diagnostic environment and must pass the CORS/CSRF/audience contract.
